vels to the ground, float around in a bouncy bubble or take a magical journey to the end of a rainbow. Each gentle tale is rich with soothing sound effects. So dim the lights, snuggle up and get ready for a good night's rest.   \n\nIncludes 10 relaxing tales: 'Blowing Bubbles', 'Colour Fairies', 'Sky Magic', 'Inside the Cosy Cocoon', 'Special Rabbit', 'Sleepy Sandcastles', 'The Drifting Snowflake', 'Sunflower Snuggles', 'A Bedtime Picture' and 'The Sleepy King'.","category":"stories","author":"Ladybird","previewAudio":"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0051/8845/2401/files/ladybird-sleepy-tales.mp3","abridged":false,"accent":"UK English","audioPreviewUrl":"https://audio-previews-media.api.yotoplay.com/cards/products/ladybird-sleepy-tales.mp3","copyright":"© 2019 Ladybird ℗ 2019 Penguin Audio","maxAge":8,"minAge":3,"cover":{"imageL":"https://card-content.yotoplay.com/yoto/pub/ncPUcoVqQRDKeAp4xkwpG14YhdxVFEX6Dg0hgciWdiM"},"status":{"name":"live","updatedAt":"2020-10-29T14:38:36.454Z"},"languages":["en"],"media":{"duration":9000,"fileSize":74140350,"hasStreams":false},"accents":["UK English"],"authors":["Ladybird"],"copyrights":["© 2019 Ladybird ℗ 2019 Penguin Audio"],"genres":["bedtime-stories"],"narrators":["Candida Gubbins"]},"slug":"ladybird-sleepy-tales","title":"Ladybird Sleepy Tales","updatedAt":"2024-06-11T09:51:11.687Z","userId":"yoto","clubAvailability":[],"sortkey":"ladybird-sleepy-tales"},"ownership":{"canAccess":true,"userHasRole":false,"cardIsFree":false,"cardIsMadeByUser":false,"cardIsInFamilyLibrary":false,"cardIsCreatedByFamily":false,"isAccessibleUsingSubscription":false,"isAccessibleAsPhysicalPlay":false,"isShareLink":false,"isReconditionCard":false,"inCardPacks":false,"previewAccessOnly":true}}